          0&#xA;&#xA;          p3c5.rd         p3c5.day    p3c5.mm      p3c5.sd                 p3c5.n p3c5.noo p3c5.no_NAs&#xA;    1     2010-01-04             0   0.07987147   0.006508766              7                1           0&#xA;    2     2010-01-06             2   0.11496167   0.046478767              8                0           0&#xA;    3     2010-01-09             5   0.40326471   0.210217097              7                1           0&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="207258" LastActivityDate="2010-02-25T04:32:39.383" Title="How to reference columns of a data.frame within a data.frame?" Tags="&lt;r&gt;&lt;dataframe&gt;" AnswerCount="3" CommentCount="2" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 2.5" />
