  <row Id="20814" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="20885" CreationDate="2008-08-21T19:05:34.180" Score="8" ViewCount="2026" Body="&lt;p&gt;In the Visual Studio designer, how do you move a menu item from one menu to another?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I would assume drag and drop would work, but it seems to only work within a menu for me.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I usually resort to editing the .Designer.cs files by hand.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="1490" OwnerDisplayName="Nick" LastEditorUserId="63550" LastEditorDisplayName="moocha" LastEditDate="2018-02-13T17:59:27.087" LastActivityDate="2018-02-13T18:01:16.413" Title="How do I move an item from one menu to another?" Tags="&lt;c#&gt;&lt;winforms&gt;&lt;visual-studio-2005&gt;" AnswerCount="1" CommentCount="0" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 3.0" />
