  <row Id="23064" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="23067" CreationDate="2008-08-22T18:07:56.917" Score="4" ViewCount="3935" Body="&lt;p&gt;I'm creating an application that will store a hierarchical collection of items in an XML file and I'm wondering about the industry standard for storing collections in XML. Which of the following two formats is preferred? (If there is another option I'm not seeing, please advise.)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;School&amp;gt;&#xA;    &amp;lt;Student Name=&quot;Jack&quot; /&amp;gt;&#xA;    &amp;lt;Student Name=&quot;Jill&quot; /&amp;gt;&#xA;    &amp;lt;Class Name=&quot;English 101&quot; /&amp;gt;&#xA;    &amp;lt;Class Name=&quot;Math 101&quot; /&amp;gt;&#xA;&amp;lt;/School&amp;gt;&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option B&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;School&amp;gt;&#xA;    &amp;lt;Students&amp;gt;&#xA;        &amp;lt;Student Name=&quot;Jack&quot; /&amp;gt;&#xA;        &amp;lt;Student Name=&quot;Jill&quot; /&amp;gt;&#xA;    &amp;lt;/Students&amp;gt;&#xA;    &amp;lt;Classes&amp;gt;&#xA;        &amp;lt;Class Name=&quot;English 101&quot; /&amp;gt;&#xA;        &amp;lt;Class Name=&quot;Math 101&quot; /&amp;gt;&#xA;    &amp;lt;/Classes&amp;gt;&#xA;&amp;lt;/School&amp;gt;&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="317" OwnerDisplayName="Joseph Sturtevant" LastEditorUserId="2134" LastEditorDisplayName="Chris Fournier" LastEditDate="2008-08-23T18:16:41.693" LastActivityDate="2013-01-23T06:36:19.007" Title="XML Collection Best Practices" Tags="&lt;xml&gt;" AnswerCount="4" CommentCount="0" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 2.5" />
