  <row Id="24881" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="24882" CreationDate="2008-08-24T06:30:09.760" Score="126" ViewCount="364921" Body="&lt;p&gt;I'm trying to solve &lt;a href=&quot;http://uva.onlinejudge.org/external/1/100.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot;&gt;the 3n+1 problem&lt;/a&gt; and I have a &lt;code&gt;for&lt;/code&gt; loop that looks like this: &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;for(int i = low; i &amp;lt;= high; ++i)&#xA;        {&#xA;                res = runalg(i);&#xA;                if (res &amp;gt; highestres)&#xA;                {&#xA;                        highestres = res;&#xA;                }&#xA;&#xA;        }&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately I'm getting this error when I try to compile with GCC:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;3np1.c:15: error: 'for' loop initial&#xA;  declaration used outside C99 mode&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I don't know what C99 mode is. Any ideas?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="2128" OwnerDisplayName="The.Anti.9" LastEditorUserId="1084554" LastEditorDisplayName="Chris Fournier" LastEditDate="2013-10-30T19:35:02.323" LastActivityDate="2019-09-29T13:54:12.940" Title="How do I fix &quot;for loop initial declaration used outside C99 mode&quot; GCC error?" Tags="&lt;c&gt;&lt;gcc&gt;&lt;for-loop&gt;" AnswerCount="11" CommentCount="0" FavoriteCount="28" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 3.0" />
