t(x)&#xA;&#xA;@ &#xA;&#xA; }&#xA;\end{tablehere}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;which leads to&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;\begin{tablehere}&#xA;{&#xA;&#xA; [1] &quot;% latex table generated in R 2.9.2 by xtable 1.5-5 package&quot;&#xA; [2] &quot;% Mon May 17 20:23:09 2010&quot;                                &#xA; [3] &quot;\\begin{table}[ht]&quot;                                        &#xA; [4] &quot;\\begin{center}&quot;                                           &#xA; [5] &quot;&quot;                                                          &#xA; [6] &quot;  \\hline&quot;                                                 &#xA; [7] &quot; &amp;amp; Turn &amp;amp; Draw &amp;amp; Turn &amp;amp; Draw \\\\ &quot;                        &#xA; [8] &quot;  \\hline&quot;                                                 &#xA; [9] &quot;1 &amp;amp; 1.00 &amp;amp; -1.76 &amp;amp; 6.00 &amp;amp; 0.70 \\\\ &quot;                      &#xA;[10] &quot;  2 &amp;amp; 2.00 &amp;amp; 1.58 &amp;amp; 7.00 &amp;amp; 2.57 \\\\ &quot;                     &#xA;[11] &quot;  3 &amp;amp; 3.00 &amp;amp; -1.80 &amp;amp; 8.00 &amp;amp; 0.47 \\\\ &quot;                    &#xA;[12] &quot;  4 &amp;amp; 4.00 &amp;amp; -2.25 &amp;amp; 9.00 &amp;amp; -0.63 \\\\ &quot;                   &#xA;[13] &quot;  5 &amp;amp; 5.00 &amp;amp; 1.99 &amp;amp; 10.00 &amp;amp; -0.35 \\\\ &quot;                   &#xA;[14] &quot;   \\hline&quot;                                                &#xA;[15] &quot;&quot;                                                          &#xA;[16] &quot;\\end{center}&quot;                                             &#xA;[17] &quot;\\end{table}&quot;                                                  &#xA; }&#xA;\end{tablehere}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;which is so close. How do I get R to print the right way?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="318976" LastEditorUserId="318976" LastEditDate="2010-05-18T00:24:02.667" LastActivityDate="2010-05-