  <row Id="30454" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="30586" CreationDate="2008-08-27T15:31:27.517" Score="4" ViewCount="2665" Body="&lt;p&gt;So I wrote some perl that would parse results returned from the &lt;a href=&quot;http://aws.amazon.com/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services&lt;/a&gt;. I am using the &lt;code&gt;XML::Simple&lt;/code&gt; package.  For the most part, everything worked when I pulled out an element.  However, the problem I ran into was when an element had an attribute as well.  Then I get an error that the item is a Hash.  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here's what I did if I wanted to get the Running Time for a DVD: I just created an item to hold the specific info for this one-off item.  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;// XML&#xA;&amp;lt;ProductGroup&amp;gt;DVD&amp;lt;/ProductGroup&amp;gt;&#xA;&amp;lt;RunningTime Units=&quot;minutes&quot;&amp;gt;90&amp;lt;/RunningTime&amp;gt;&#xA;&#xA;// Perl to parse XML&#xA;&#xA;my $item = $xml-&amp;gt;XMLin($content, KeyAttr =&amp;gt; { Item =&amp;gt; 'ASIN'}, ForceArray =&amp;gt; ['ASIN']);    &#xA;&#xA;$ProductGroup = $item-&amp;gt;{Items}-&amp;gt;{Item}-&amp;gt;{ItemAttributes}-&amp;gt;{ProductGroup};&#xA;&#xA;if(ref($item-&amp;gt;{Items}-&amp;gt;{Item}-&amp;gt;{ItemAttributes}-&amp;gt;{RunningTime}) eq 'HASH'){&#xA;    $RunningTimeXML = $xml-&amp;gt;XMLin($content, KeyAttr =&amp;gt; { Item =&amp;gt; 'ASIN'}, NoAttr =&amp;gt; 1);&#xA;    $RunningTime = $RunningTimeXML-&amp;gt;{Items}-&amp;gt;{Item}-&amp;gt;{ItemAttributes}-&amp;gt;{RunningTime};&#xA;}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Is there a way I can access both elements and attributes from one item?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="2863" OwnerDisplayName="Scott G" LastEditorUserId="352841" LastEditorDisplayName="Stu Thompson" LastEditDate="2012-05-03T02:00:52.297" LastActivityDate="2012-05-03T02:00:52.297" Title="Parsing XML Elements &amp; Attributes with Perl" Tags="&lt;xml&gt;&lt;perl&gt;&lt;amazon-web-services&gt;" AnswerCount="1" CommentCount="0" FavoriteCount="1" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 3.0" />
