  <row Id="31480" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="31485" CreationDate="2008-08-28T01:38:47.073" Score="6" ViewCount="567" Body="&lt;p&gt;How stable is WPF not in terms of stability of a WPF program, but in terms of the 'stability' of the API itself.  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Let me explain:  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Microsoft is notorious for changing its whole methodology around with new technology. Like with the move from silverlight 1 to silverlight 2. With WPF, I know that MS changed a bunch of stuff with the release of the .NET service pack. I don't know how much they changed things around. So the bottom line is, in your opinion are they going to revamp the system again with the next release or do you think that it is stable enough now that they won't change the bulk of the system. I hate to have to unlearn stuff with every release.  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I hope that the question wasn't too long winded.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="2976" OwnerDisplayName="paan" LastEditorUserId="3218692" LastEditorDisplayName="A. Rex" LastEditDate="2015-11-20T11:37:33.767" LastActivityDate="2015-11-20T11:37:33.767" Title="How stable is WPF?" Tags="&lt;.net&gt;&lt;wpf&gt;" AnswerCount="3" CommentCount="0" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 3.0" />
  <row Id="31494" PostTypeId="1" CreationDate="2008-08-28T01:54:18.500" Score="15" ViewCount="13639" Body="&lt;p&gt;I have got a simple contacts database but I'm having problems with users entering in duplicate data. I have implemented a simple data comparison but unfortunately the duplicated data that is being entered is not exactly the same. For example, names are incorrectly spelled or one person will put in 'Bill Smith' and another will put in 'William Smith' for the same person.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;So is there some sort of algorithm that can give a percentage for how similar an entry is to another?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="486" OwnerDisplayName="grom" LastEditorUserId="35" LastEditorDisplayName="Greg Hurlman" LastEditDate="2008-08-28T03:34:36.233" LastActivityDate="2019-07-27T05:13:38.453" Title="How to detect duplicate data?" Tags="&lt;algorithm&gt;&lt;language-agnostic&gt;&lt;duplicate-data&gt;" AnswerCount="11" CommentCount="0" FavoriteCount="9" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 2.5" />
