  <row Id="3453695" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="3454648" CreationDate="2010-08-10T21:43:55.853" Score="26" ViewCount="65035" Body="&lt;p&gt;I am an R newbie and had a question. I am trying to place some text into an R plot. Here's some code using the brightness dataset in the UsingR package.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;    library(UsingR)&#xA;    brightness&#xA;&#xA;    MyMean &amp;lt;- mean(brightness)&#xA;    MyMedian &amp;lt;- median(brightness)&#xA;    MySd &amp;lt;- sd(brightness)&#xA;&#xA;    hist(brightness, breaks=35, main=&quot;This is a Histogram&quot;, &#xA;         xlab=&quot;Brightness&quot;, ylab=&quot;Frequency&quot;, xlim=c(0,15), ylim=c(0, 200))&#xA;&#xA;    text(3.5, 150, paste(&quot;Mean =&quot;, round(MyMean, 1), &quot;\n Median =&quot;, &#xA;         round(MyMedian, 1), &quot;\n Std.Dev =&quot;, round(MySd, 1)))&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This code produces:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.stack.imgur.com/x8qKL.png&quot; alt=&quot;enter image description here&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The issue with this output is that the text is not left left alligned. Does anyone know how to make the text left alligned.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="406278" LastEditorUserId="6607497" LastEditDate="2017-05-16T12:10:02.343" LastActivityDate="2021-12-10T03:30:26.060" Title="Align text inside a plot" Tags="&lt;r&gt;&lt;text&gt;&lt;text-alignment&gt;" AnswerCount="2" CommentCount="0" FavoriteCount="7" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 3.0" />
