  <row Id="3753341" PostTypeId="1" CreationDate="2010-09-20T16:13:32.820" Score="1" ViewCount="369" Body="&lt;p&gt;I have a large dataset with repeat assessment across subjects. How do I go from:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;subj, assessment, test1, test2  &#xA;A,    1,          10,    20  &#xA;A,    2,          12,    13  &#xA;A,    3,          11,    12  &#xA;B,    1,          14,    14  &#xA;B,    2,          13,    12&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;subj, test1_1, test1_2, test1_3  &#xA;A,    10,      12,      11  &#xA;B,    14,      13  &#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Thanks,&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Jon&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="452923" LastEditorUserId="219519" LastEditDate="2014-02-11T10:27:18.227" LastActivityDate="2014-02-11T10:27:18.227" Title="R reorder dataframe within subject" Tags="&lt;r&gt;&lt;reshape&gt;&lt;reshape2&gt;" AnswerCount="2" CommentCount="0" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 3.0" />
