rmation from WMI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Any help with either would be great.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="5133" OwnerDisplayName="Merus" LastEditorUserId="1537726" LastEditorDisplayName="Merus" LastEditDate="2014-05-04T22:00:46.127" LastActivityDate="2014-05-04T22:00:46.127" Title="Connecting to registry remotely, and getting exceptions" Tags="&lt;c#&gt;&lt;windows&gt;&lt;exception&gt;" AnswerCount="3" CommentCount="0" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 3.0" />
