  <row Id="4248790" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="4249148" CreationDate="2010-11-22T18:20:57.580" Score="3" ViewCount="343" Body="&lt;p&gt;I am programming an &lt;a href=&quot;http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Expectation-maximization_algorithm&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;expectation-maximization algorithm&lt;/a&gt; with R. In order to speed-up the computation, I would like to vectorize this bottleneck. I know that N is about a hundred times k.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;MyLoglik = 0&#xA;for (i in c(1:N))&#xA;{&#xA; for (j in c(1:k))&#xA; {&#xA;  MyLoglik = MyLoglik + MyTau[i,j]*log(MyP[j]*MyF(MyD[i,], MyMu[j,], MyS[[j]]))&#xA; }&#xA;}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;There is also this list of matrices:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;MyDf.list &amp;lt;- vector(&quot;list&quot;, k)&#xA;for(i in 1:k)&#xA;{&#xA; MyDf.list[[i]] &amp;lt;- matrix(0,d,d)&#xA; for (j in c(1:N))&#xA; {&#xA;  MyDf.list[[i]] = MyDf.list[[i]] + MyTau[j,i]*as.numeric((MyD[j,]-MyMu[i,])) %*% t(as.numeric(MyD[j,]-MyMu[i,]))  &#xA; }&#xA; MyDf.list[[i]] = MyDf.list[[i]] / MyM[i]&#xA;}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I have sped things up a bit using:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;MyLoglik = 0&#xA;for (j in c(1:k))&#xA;{&#xA; MyR= apply(MyD, 1, function(x) log(MyP[j]*MyF(x, MyMu[j,], MyS[[j]])))&#xA; MyLoglik = MyLoglik + sum(MyTau[,j]*MyR)&#xA;}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;and:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;d = dim(MyD)[2]&#xA;MyDf.list &amp;lt;- vector(&quot;list&quot;, k)&#xA;for(i in 1:k)&#xA;{&#xA; MyDf.list[[i]] &amp;lt;- matrix(0,d,d)&#xA; MyR= apply(MyD, 1, function(x) as.numeric((x-MyMu[i,])) %*% t(as.numeric(x-MyMu[i,])))&#xA; MyDf.list[[i]] = matrix(rowSums(t(MyTau[,i]*t(MyR))) / MyM[i],d,d)&#xA;}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="376454" LastEditorUserId="3923281" LastEditDate="2017-09-26T12:41:23.103" LastActivityDate="2017-09-26T12:41:23.103" Title="How to speed this kind of double for-loop?" Tags="&lt;r&gt;&lt;performance&gt;&lt;for-loop&gt;&lt;vectorization&gt;&lt;expectation-maximization&gt;" AnswerCount="3" CommentCount="0" FavoriteCount="1" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 2.5" />
