  <row Id="4253437" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="4268260" CreationDate="2010-11-23T06:45:54.577" Score="0" ViewCount="164" Body="&lt;p&gt;I have tried the following code, and then R exits unexpectedly:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;temp &amp;lt;- rep(as.Date(&quot;2009-01-01&quot;)+1:365, 365)&#xA;print(temp)&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Anyone tried this before, is it a bug, or if there is anything I can do?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I have increase the memory available for R from 1024M to 2047M, but the same thing happens.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;UPDATE #1&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here's my sessionInfo()&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt; sessionInfo()&#xA;R version 2.11.0 (2010-04-22) &#xA;i386-pc-mingw32 &#xA;&#xA;locale:&#xA;[1] LC_COLLATE=Chinese_Hong Kong S.A.R..950  LC_CTYPE=Chinese_Hong Kong S.A.R..950   &#xA;[3] LC_MONETARY=Chinese_Hong Kong S.A.R..950 LC_NUMERIC=C                            &#xA;[5] LC_TIME=Chinese_Hong Kong S.A.R..950    &#xA;&#xA;attached base packages:&#xA;[1] stats     graphics  grDevices utils     datasets  methods   base     &#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;And actually I am trying to do some format(foo, &quot;%y%M&quot;), but it also exit unexpectedly - for &quot;unexpectedly&quot;, I mean R closes itself without any signs. Thanks again.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="373908" LastEditorUserId="373908" LastEditDate="2010-11-24T01:02:27.147" LastActivityDate="2010-11-24T15:09:44.050" Title="R exits unexpectedly when trying to print a date vector with length more than 130K" Tags="&lt;datetime&gt;&lt;r&gt;" AnswerCount="2" CommentCount="7" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 2.5" />
