  <row Id="55056" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="840596" CreationDate="2008-09-10T19:09:14.600" Score="114" ViewCount="50994" Body="&lt;p&gt;I'm building a Django project that needs search functionality, and until there's a &lt;code&gt;django.contrib.search&lt;/code&gt;, I have to choose a search app. So, which is the best? By &quot;best&quot; I mean...&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;easy to install / set up&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;has a Django- or at least Python-friendly API&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;can perform reasonably complex searches&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here are some apps I've heard of, please suggest others if you know of any:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://code.google.com/p/djangosearch/&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot;&gt;djangosearch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://code.google.com/p/django-sphinx/&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot;&gt;django-sphinx&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I'd also like to avoid using a third-party search engine (like Google SiteSearch), because some of the data I'd like to index is for site members only and should not be public.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="5616" OwnerDisplayName="Justin Voss" LastActivityDate="2012-05-13T15:22:19.900" Title="What's the best Django search app?" Tags="&lt;python&gt;&lt;django&gt;&lt;search&gt;&lt;search-engine&gt;" AnswerCount="15" CommentCount="3" FavoriteCount="75" ClosedDate="2012-05-13T19:02:21.443" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 2.5" />
