  <row Id="4551582" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="4551809" CreationDate="2010-12-29T04:56:15.850" Score="24" ViewCount="12874" Body="&lt;p&gt;I am trying to combine a histogram and boxplot for visualizing a continuous variable. Here is the code I have so far&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;require(ggplot2)&#xA;require(gridExtra)&#xA;p1 = qplot(x = 1, y = mpg, data = mtcars, xlab = &quot;&quot;, geom = 'boxplot') + &#xA;     coord_flip()&#xA;p2 = qplot(x = mpg, data = mtcars, geom = 'histogram')&#xA;grid.arrange(p2, p1, widths = c(1, 2))&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.stack.imgur.com/zxZh1.png&quot; alt=&quot;plot&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It looks fine except for the alignment of the x axes. Can anyone tell me how I can align them?&#xA;Alternately, if someone has a better way of making this graph using &lt;code&gt;ggplot2&lt;/code&gt;, that would be appreciated as well.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="235349" LastEditorUserId="3604745" LastEditDate="2016-09-08T02:14:30.923" LastActivityDate="2018-04-25T15:25:45.593" Title="Combination Boxplot and Histogram using ggplot2" Tags="&lt;r&gt;&lt;ggplot2&gt;&lt;histogram&gt;&lt;boxplot&gt;" AnswerCount="4" CommentCount="1" FavoriteCount="14" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 3.0" />
  <row Id="57484" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="57526" CreationDate="2008-09-11T20:04:17.563" Score="79" ViewCount="102899" Body="&lt;p&gt;I'm trying to do a basic &quot;OR&quot; on three fields using a hibernate criteria query.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Example&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;class Whatever{&#xA; string name;&#xA; string address;&#xA; string phoneNumber;&#xA;}&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I'd like to build a criteria query where my search string could match &quot;name&quot; or &quot;address&quot; or &quot;phoneNumber&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="1310" OwnerDisplayName="ScArcher2" LastEditorUserId="1310" LastEditorDisplayName="ScArcher2" LastEditDate="2008-09-11T20:10:16.533" LastActivityDate="2020-07-30T22:00:03.327" Title="How do you &quot;OR&quot; criteria together when using a criteria query with hibernate?" Tags="&lt;java&gt;&lt;hibernate&gt;" AnswerCount="8" CommentCount="0" FavoriteCount="29" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 2.5" />
