  <row Id="61342" PostTypeId="1" AcceptedAnswerId="61351" CreationDate="2008-09-14T13:56:14.990" Score="8" ViewCount="464" Body="&lt;p&gt;How do you make your application multithreaded ?&#xA;Do you use asynch functions ?&#xA;or do you spawn a new thread ?&#xA;I think that asynch functions are already spawning a thread so if your job is doing just some file reading, being lazy and just spawning your job on a thread would just &quot;waste&quot; ressources...&#xA;So is there some kind of design when using thread or asynch functions ?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;" OwnerUserId="2566" OwnerDisplayName="CiNN" LastEditorUserId="33" LastEditorDisplayName="John" LastEditDate="2008-09-14T14:00:35.430" LastActivityDate="2008-09-16T12:04:22.993" Title="Threads or asynch?" Tags="&lt;multithreading&gt;&lt;language-agnostic&gt;" AnswerCount="5" CommentCount="0" FavoriteCount="1" ContentLicense="CC BY-SA 2.5" />
